                  North Badda, Gulshan, Dhaka-1212, Bangladesh. <br />
                  E-mail: info@suffixit.com <br />
                  Phone: +88 01958 424000
                </p>
                <ul className='footer-social-link' style={{ display: 'flex', gap: '12px', padding: 0, marginBottom: 30 }}>
